# Duke-Owens variant (tilt-law points), Au+Au: the reference switches with HIJING's own PDF for the triggered pair
# (no AMPT_HQPDF) and HIJING nuclear shadowing x 0.4 as the event weight (AMPT_HQSHAD=0.4). Arms dm23_a, dm23_b
# (= dm23_ab; offline re-weightings dm23_ab__none, dm23_ab__hij10).
INPUT=auau200_lf_s6.ampt
DMENV="AMPT_HQTRIG=1 AMPT_HQCLEAN=1 AMPT_HQDIRECT=1 AMPT_DSTAR1=1 AMPT_HQFRAG=1 AMPT_HQPR=0.5 AMPT_HQPM=0.5 AMPT_CHARM_OUT=1 AMPT_COALNEW=1 AMPT_HQMTMODE=1 AMPT_CNORDER=2 AMPT_ECRIT=1.0 AMPT_RBMHQ=3 AMPT_SIGHQ=1.5 AMPT_HQLATE=0 AMPT_HQMTMAX=3.3 AMPT_LQFRAC=0.05 AMPT_HQISO=1 AMPT_HQISO_PCUT=0.5 AMPT_HQSHAD=0.4 AMPT_HQSHW=1 AMPT_HQCONST=1"
